--- !u!114 &1389522805
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1389522804}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c86ae63c5b6f9b54291450cfca667b1b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::WhaleInteraction
  speakerName: Whale
  postCrabQuestDialogueLines:
  - speaker: Seahorse
    text: Mr. Jones!
    sfxClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b1f66267cfee0ff48b607e750ccf57b0, type: 3}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: ...
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Seahorse
    text: Mr. Jones?
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: ...
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Sea Horse
    text: "..\u2026\u2026(gasp)"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Seahorse
    text: MR.JONES!!!!
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Narrator
    text: (The heavy movement of the moving belt stirred up sand, and Mr. Jones opened
      his eyes.)
    sfxClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4ba7d5e7329e3784fa426e48c2750c37, type: 3}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Sea Horse
    text: My house is falling apart! When I bought it, the developer promised me
      it was built with the finest coral and would remain solid as a rock for thousands
      of years. So why is it crumbling to pieces after just two years?
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: Yes...I can feel this......
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: The ocean... Is getting warmer...and warmer......
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: "When the water changes\u2026 the algae leave the coral."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: "Without them\u2026 the coral cannot survive."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Sea Horse
    text: But why is this happening now?!
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Sea Horse
    text: "It wasn\u2019t like this before!"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: Because...humans have started interfering again....
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Sea Horse
    text: Humans?
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Sea Horse
    text: What are they doing in our place?
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: You will...find out......
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Sea Horse
    text: Wait wait wait. So, how can I stop them? I need to save my house from falling
      apart! It cost me greatly!
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: "There was once\u2026an agreement\u2026"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 69c1c5afb8222f3438a94c00ed97a47e, type: 3}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: "Between the ocean\u2026 and humanity."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: "If the ocean was ever in danger\u2026we had a way to call them\u2026"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: We play a symphony, and humans will help us...
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: "The melody was divided\u2026kept by different species."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: "Only when all parts are played together\u2026can humans understand us."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Sea Horse
    text: "Then\u2026 we just need to gather them, right?"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: "It won\u2019t be that simple...The ocean is no longer united..."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: "Many species no longer trust each other\u2026"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: or humans...
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: "If you want their help\u2026"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: you must go find them.
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: "The crabs has a part\u2026You can start with them\u2026"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: They live not far from here...
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: "If the waters are polluted\u2026they must already be struggling..."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: Head right...and follow the current past the cliff to the waters where
      they live...
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Sea Horse
    text: "I\u2019ll convince them."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: "\u2026Be careful."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 69c1c5afb8222f3438a94c00ed97a47e, type: 3}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: "Not everyone will welcome you\u2026"
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Narrator
    text: (And Mr.Jones closed his eyes, fall asleep again.)
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  repeatDialogueLines:
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: ......
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  randomRepeatDialogueBlocks: []
  postDolphinQuestDialogueLines:
  - speaker: Sea Horse
    text: Mr. Jones, I'm back.
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Narrator
    text: (Mr. Jones opened his eyes.)
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: You made it...
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: Good job...
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Narrator
    text: (Mr. Jones looked at Bob.)
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: "\u2026Good...One piece\u2026found."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: "They don\u2019t trust easily...You did well."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Sea Horse
    text: Where do I go next?
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: "\u2026The dolphins."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Sea Horse
    text: Ok. I'll go.
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  postOctopusQuestDialogueLines:
  - speaker: Sea Horse
    text: "Mr. Jones\u2026 I\u2019m back."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: "\u2026Mm. I can hear it..."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: "\u2026A strong voice."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: Now find the others. Before the ocean goes silent.
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Sea Horse
    text: Who's next?
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: "\u2026The octopus."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: Hurry up, time is running out.
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: "Their home\u2026 is being torn apart by machines..."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Sea Horse
    text: "I understand. I\u2019ll help them."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  postSeaCucumberQuestDialogueLines:
  - speaker: Sea Horse
    text: "Mr. Jones\u2026 I\u2019m back."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: "The rhythm\u2026 is stronger now."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: You found Shrauk...Good...
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: Then you'll only need one last piece...
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Sea Horse
    text: Who has it?
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: Dr. Luma...
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: The sea cucumber.
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: "He heals\u2026what others cannot."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: Let Shrauk take you there...
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  afterSeaCucumberCompletedDialogueLines:
  - speaker: Sea Horse
    text: "Mr. Jones\u2026Everyone\u2019s here."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Narrator
    text: (Mr. Jones slowly opens his eyes.)
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: "\u2026Yes. I can hear it clearly now."
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: You did it.
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: You brought them together.
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  ensemblePromptDialogueLines:
  - speaker: Mr. Jones
    text: are you ready
    sfxClip: {fileID: 0}
    sfxVolumeScale: 1
  ensembleYesLabel: Yes
  ensembleNoLabel: No
  endingSceneName: ChorusScene
  objectToActivate: {fileID: 85474048}
